The registry-first sample tests/registry/nl.jsonl contains addresses and coordinates from
Kadaster's BAG GeoPackage of 2026-10-01, distributed by PDOK under CC0-1.0
(https://service.pdok.nl/kadaster/bag/atom/bag.xml). Coordinates were transformed from
EPSG:28992 to EPSG:4326 with DuckDB spatial / PROJ. Per-case prepared-CSV checksums and
retrieval dates are recorded in the corpus; docs/registry/nl.md records the upstream file checksum.
